This project includes kernel designs and inference features adapted from the
following Apache-2.0 licensed open-source projects:

1. satellitedown/inkling-2-mini-abliterated-ingine (Apache License 2.0)
   https://github.com/satellitedown/inkling-2-mini-abliterated-ingine
   - Runtime-gated Fisher-LDA directional ablation tensor schema & projection formula
     (optional `--ablation <path.safetensors>` support in src/weights.zig,
     cuda/kernels_inkling.cu, and cuda/kernels_prefill.cu).
   - Blackwell Programmatic Dependent Launch (PDL) overlap pattern and register-
     permuted Tensor Core `mma.m16n8k16` decode MoE and dense NVFP4 GEMV structure
     (cuda/kernels_common.cuh, cuda/kernels_gemv.cu, cuda/kernels_inkling.cu).
   - Device-side adaptive `{2, 4, 8}` DSpark speculative verify width selection via
     CUDA Graph conditional switch (`cudaGraphCondTypeSwitch`) and Markov-head
     online softmax confidence scoring (cuda/kernels_dspark.cu, cuda/cuda_abi.cu,
     src/engine.zig).
   - Multi-stage `cp.async` `128x128x64` grouped MoE GEMM pipeline structure for
     prefill, specialized for Blackwell `cvt.rn.f16x2.e2m1x2` + FP16 MMA
     (cuda/kernels_prefill.cu).
   - Offline Fisher-LDA abliteration generation and refusal evaluation tools
     (tools/ablate.py, tools/inkling_ref.py, tools/refusal_eval.py,
     tools/requirements.txt), adapted to evaluate refusals via `squid5090 serve`.

2. Inkling-2-Mini model architecture & tokenizer specification (Apache License 2.0)
   Thinking Machines / Inkling-2-Mini.
